  },
  data: {
    LLM: '1. **Deal**: Four cards each from a 32-card deck. 2. **Play**: Four tricks are played; players follow suit when able, otherwise discard any card. 3. **Trick winner**: Highest card of the led suit wins and leads next. 4. **Knocking**: After players pick up cards, and at any time during the hand, a player may knock to raise the stake by one life. 5. **Fold or stay**: Opponents may fold (take current loss) or continue. 6. **Hand result**: Winner of trick four avoids loss; others who stayed lose according to the raised stake. 7. **Elimination**: In Siwweschroom, players reaching seven penalty points drop out; last survivor wins.',
    Player: '1. **Deal**: Four cards each from a 32-card deck. 2. **Play**: Four tricks are played; players follow suit when able, otherwise discard any card. 3. **Trick winner**: Highest card of the led suit wins and leads next. 4. **Knocking**: After players pick up cards, and at any time during the hand, a player may knock to raise the stake by one life. 5. **Fold or stay**: Opponents may fold (take current loss) or continue. 6. **Hand result**: Winner of trick four avoids loss; others who stayed lose according to the raised stake. 7. **Elimination**: In Siwweschroom, players reaching seven penalty points drop out; last survivor wins.',
    objective: 'Avoid penalty points by winning the fourth (last) trick, or by staying out of expensive losing positions after knocks.',
    gameplay: '1. **Deal**: Four cards each from a 32-card deck. 2. **Play**: Four tricks are played; players follow suit when able, otherwise discard any card. 3. **Trick winner**: Highest card of the led suit wins and leads next. 4. **Knocking**: After players pick up cards, and at any time during the hand, a player may knock to raise the stake by one life. 5. **Fold or stay**: Opponents may fold (take current loss) or continue. 6. **Hand result**: Winner of trick four avoids loss; others who stayed lose according to the raised stake. 7. **Elimination**: In Siwweschroom, players reaching seven penalty points drop out; last survivor wins.',
    keyRules: [
      'No trumps are used.',
      'Only the last trick decides the hand winner.',
      'Knocks raise risk for everyone still in.',
      'A player cannot knock and then fold to that same knock.',
      'Siwweschroom end condition is elimination at 7 points, not a fixed 10-point loser rule.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
